vsearch
------------------------------------------
USEARCH-compatible metagenomic sequence tool

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcityhash0-1.1.1-1bl4
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  libcityhash-devel-1.1.1-1bl4
  make-4.4.1-2
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/torognes/vsearch

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/torognes/vsearch/archive/refs/tags/v2.32.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack vsearch-2.32.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./vsearch-2.32.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/vsearch-2.32.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/vsearch-2.32.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(vsearch)
  /usr/bin/vsearch.exe
  /usr/share/bash-completion/completions/vsearch
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/vsearch.README
  /usr/share/doc/vsearch/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/vsearch/LICENSE_GNU_GPL3.txt
  /usr/share/doc/vsearch/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/vsearch/README.md
  /usr/share/fish/vendor_completions.d/vsearch.fish
  /usr/share/zsh/site-functions/_vsearch

